1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,210
Hello everyone.

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:07,381
It’s good to see that so many members of the public have shown up

3
00:00:07,381 --> 00:00:13,460
for our presentation on the new housing development planned on the outskirts of Nunston.

4
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:19,930
I’m Mark Reynolds and I’m Communications Manager at the development.

5
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:25,222
I’ll start by giving you a brief overview of our plans for the

6
00:00:25,222 --> 00:00:25,600
development.

7
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:32,415
So one thing I’m sure you’ll want to know is why we’ve selected this

8
00:00:32,415 --> 00:00:34,820
particular site for a housing development.

9
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:41,549
At present it’s being used for farming, like much of the land around

10
00:00:41,549 --> 00:00:42,030
Nunston.

11
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:48,489
But because of the new industrial centre in Nunston, there’s a lot of demand

12
00:00:48,489 --> 00:00:54,518
for housing for employees in the region, as many employees are having to commute

13
00:00:54,518 --> 00:00:56,240
long distances at present.

14
00:00:56,240 --> 00:01:02,719
Of course, there’s also the fact that we have an international airport just 20

15
00:01:02,719 --> 00:01:04,015
minutes’ drive away,

16
00:01:04,015 --> 00:01:10,926
but although that’s certainly convenient, it wasn’t one of our major criteria for choosing

17
00:01:10,926 --> 00:01:11,790
the site.

18
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:18,846
We were more interested in the fact that there’s an excellent hospital just 15

19
00:01:18,846 --> 00:01:19,787
kilometres away,

20
00:01:19,787 --> 00:01:24,020
and a large secondary school even closer than that.

21
00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:30,062
One drawback to the site is that it’s on quite a steep slope,

22
00:01:30,062 --> 00:01:36,967
but we’ve taken account of that in our planning so it shouldn’t be a

23
00:01:36,967 --> 00:01:37,830
major problem.

24
00:01:37,830 --> 00:01:42,040
We’ve had a lot of positive feedback about the plans.

25
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:46,454
People like the wide variety of accommodation types and prices,

26
00:01:46,454 --> 00:01:53,074
and the fact that it’s only a short drive to get out into the

27
00:01:53,074 --> 00:01:54,840
countryside from the development.

28
00:01:54,840 --> 00:02:01,129
We were particularly pleased that so many people liked the designs for the layout

29
00:02:01,129 --> 00:02:07,867
of the development, with the majority of people saying it generally made a good impression

30
00:02:07,867 --> 00:02:15,504
and blended in well with the natural features of the landscape, with provision made for protecting trees

31
00:02:15,504 --> 00:02:17,750
and wildlife on the site.

32
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:24,126
Some people have mentioned that they’d like to see more facilities for cyclists,

33
00:02:24,126 --> 00:02:26,858
and we’ll look at that,

34
00:02:26,858 --> 00:02:33,234
but the overall feedback has been that the design and facilities of the development

35
00:02:33,234 --> 00:02:39,610
make it seem a place where people of all ages can live together happily.

36
00:02:39,610 --> 00:02:39,660
OK.

37
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:47,690
So I’ll put a map of the proposed development up on the screen.

38
00:02:47,690 --> 00:02:53,423
You’ll see it’s bounded on the south side by the main road,

39
00:02:53,423 --> 00:02:55,880
which then goes on to Nunston.

40
00:02:55,880 --> 00:03:02,770
Another boundary is formed by London Road, on the western side of the development.

41
00:03:02,770 --> 00:03:10,450
Inside the development there’ll be about 400 houses and 3 apartment blocks.

42
00:03:10,450 --> 00:03:16,410
There’ll also be a school for children up to 11 years old.

43
00:03:16,410 --> 00:03:21,458
If you look at the South Entrance at the bottom of the map, there’s

44
00:03:21,458 --> 00:03:25,160
a road from there that goes right up through the development.

45
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:31,073
The school will be on that road, at the corner of the second turning

46
00:03:31,073 --> 00:03:32,340
to the left.

47
00:03:32,340 --> 00:03:40,170
A large sports centre is planned with facilities for indoor and outdoor activities.

48
00:03:40,170 --> 00:03:46,225
This will be on the western side of the development, just below the road

49
00:03:46,225 --> 00:03:48,820
that branches off from London Road.

50
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:54,756
There’ll be a clinic where residents can go if they have any health

51
00:03:54,756 --> 00:03:55,180
problems.

52
00:03:55,180 --> 00:03:59,150
Can you see the lake towards the top of the map?

53
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:05,189
The clinic will be just below this, to the right of a street of

54
00:04:05,189 --> 00:04:05,620
houses.

55
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:10,860
There’ll also be a community centre for people of all ages.

56
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:18,324
On the northeast side of the development, there’ll be a row of specially designed

57
00:04:18,324 --> 00:04:21,309
houses specifically for residents over 65,

58
00:04:21,309 --> 00:04:25,290
and the community centre will be adjoining this.

59
00:04:25,290 --> 00:04:28,970
We haven’t forgotten about shopping.

60
00:04:28,970 --> 00:04:34,410
There’ll be a supermarket between the two entrances to the development.

61
00:04:34,410 --> 00:04:39,183
We’re planning to leave the three large trees near London Road,

62
00:04:39,183 --> 00:04:43,160
and it’ll be just to the south of these.

63
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:47,630
It’s planned to have a playground for younger children.

64
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:53,511
If you look at the road that goes up from the South Entrance, you’ll

65
00:04:53,511 --> 00:04:57,431
see it curves round to the left at the top,

66
00:04:57,431 --> 00:05:02,920
and the playground will be in that curve, with nice views of the lake.

67
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,904
OK,

68
00:05:03,904 --> 00:05:07,840
so now does anyone …
